From: Droidloom <droidloom@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] wm: always expose host system bars and keyboard in Droidloom app windows

Baseline: frameworks/base 94b4c163b7dfe5ce3607f7bb8456f9573f7de57d.

Freeform policy strips system bar sources and Android apps cannot otherwise
observe the host bars. Add per-app sources after policy and to WindowMetrics,
without Android bar windows or control leashes. The host's on-screen keyboard
is an IME source of the window's task, at the height the host reports for it,
so apps lay out around it as around Android's own keyboard. The read-only
Droidloom product marker confines this to Droidloom cells.

